<title>USA: S&amp;P adds to SmallCap 600 Index.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P adds to SmallCap 600 Index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Financial Information Services said on Thursday that it will add Unitrode Corp, Metro Networks Inc and W.H. Brady Co to its S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index on July 30.</p>
<p>In addition, S&amp;P said it would add Rural/Metro Corp to the index after the close of trade on July 31.</p>
<p>Rural/Metro will replace United Cities Gas Co, which is merging with Atmos Energy Corp, it added.  </p>
<p>The three companies being replaced on July 30, Core Industries Inc, Allwaste Inc and Imo Industries Inc, are being acquired by Canadian companies, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>The service said United Dominion Industries Ltd is acquiring Core Industries and Imo Industries in separate friendly cash tender offers.</p>
<p>Philip Environmental Inc is acquiring Allwaste in a stock transaction.</p>
</text>
